    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almohadin: escape from the basement</strong> is an indie fast-paced 2D precision platformer packed with colorful visuals and bullet hell action. Face a story-rich cartoony adventure inspired by difficult retro side scroller arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Basement holds many mysteries. Almohadin must take risks and uncover them in order to reach the outside world. Join him on his adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/dc5341686b53d1551ba5eb1faa26aeea.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of levels await you with progressive difficulty and the narrative of a visual novel that immerses you in the story of Almohadin, a pillow that magically comes to life and decides to escape from the basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/0539b47134108f18a4a23f93189ecac8.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> - these powerful individuals will try to kill you with all their might. Defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue</strong> - hundreds of subjects are imprisoned in the basement. Make a difference and save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massacre</strong> - annihilate all the monsters that cross your path. Cleanse the infested areas. Restore peace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics</strong> - along the way, you will find many ways to become more powerful: alfajores that enhance your movement, weapons, teleportation pills, cans of beans that help you fly (I won't explain how...), invincibility potions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these levels you must win as fast as possible. Compete against other players to see who is the fastest escapist. Some levels are extremely difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Run once again...</i></p>",
