xplain how...), invincibility potions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these levels you must win as fast as possible. Compete against other players to see who is the fastest escapist. Some levels are extremely difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Run once again...</i></p>",
